# Optional environment fallbacks.
#
# You normally DON'T need this file — keys are entered in the app and stored
# locally under data/ (gitignored). These env vars are only fallbacks if you
# prefer not to paste keys in the UI. Copy to .env.local to use them.
#
# Never commit real keys. .env and .env*.local are gitignored.

# Anthropic / Claude — powers the Product Owner and synthesis steps
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Exa — powers the Market Researcher's online discussion search
# EXA_API_KEY=

# PostHog — analytics for the landing pages / apps the pipeline ships.
# The project key is public (it goes into shipped pages); the personal key is
# private and only used server-side to read stats back into Ops / Iteration.
# POSTHOG_PROJECT_API_KEY=
# POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
# POSTHOG_PERSONAL_API_KEY=
